# Elite Quality Gates

- No change is complete without: lint, typecheck, tests, and build verification.
- Security-first defaults:
  - least privilege
  - path/capability validation
  - no broad filesystem access without explicit need
- Performance discipline:
  - prevent unnecessary runtime overhead
  - keep workflows responsive on low-power hardware
- Maintainability discipline:
  - remove dead code/config immediately
  - keep module ownership clear
  - avoid introducing hidden coupling across apps
- If quality gates fail, fix before proceeding; do not defer known regressions.
